= Digial Sensors
== MEMS - Micro-Electro-Mechanical Systems
#rect()[
  Usual flow:
  + MEMS converts physical unit into a eletronical voltage
  + ADC converts voltage into digital value/sample
  + Sofware reads ADC into memory buffer

  - Often sensors already has an ADC aka "digital sensor" and can be read directly via a serial interface (I2C, SPI, UART, etc)
]
